/-!
# Common-cover refinement and native holomorphic line-bundle comparisons

The two original scalar-cocycle bundles refine to their common
intersection cover by genuine base-preserving, fibrewise-linear
biholomorphisms. Compatible holomorphic units on that common cover then
give a biholomorphism between the original bundles, with exact local
coefficient formulas in their independently indexed original charts.
-/
